<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Solves the fourth-order unilateral mantle-margin functional via L-BFGS-B (`solve_murex_siphonal_comb`, L168-281), models planar Kirchhoff-Clebsch elastica loop folding and tubular self-contact closure at gamma >= gamma_fold (`solve_kirchhoff_elastica_spine_loop`, L287-338), synthesizes the 3-stage hierarchical wavenumber cascade k_i^* = (3*K_s/(E*h_i^3))^(1/4) for *Chicoreus ramosus* fractal fronds (`synthesize_chicoreus_fractal_frond`, L341-385), simulates episodic triradiate varix whorl accretion (`simulate_episodic_varix_whorls`, L391-443), and verifies the subcritical negative control (gamma=0.96 < gamma_c=1.08 -> 0 spines). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_077_mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 9 reference-anchored morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L732-835), including 10-species secondary/primary wavenumber ratio correlation (`r = 1.0000`, `RMSE = 0.0080`), 10-species primary spine count correlation (`r = 0.9987`, `RMSE = 0.1453 spines`), *Chicoreus ramosus* secondary/primary wavenumber ratio (`3.8011` vs `3.80`), L-BFGS-B relaxed *Murex* primary spine count (`16.0` vs `16.0`), tubular vs open-gutter neck gap delta (`-3.1059 mm`), triradiate varix angular spacing (`120.0 deg`), subcritical negative control (`0.0 mm`), and specimen comb spine count (`16` vs `16`) and spacing CV (`0.2092`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
